        "notes": "The first thing is to choose [Threads of Fate](item_cb61612b-9d83-49a9-989d-013bf084fbcb)  as your Round 1 Power; this makes it so that when you switch to a new target with the Caduceus Staff, it will also latch on to the previous target for 3 seconds with 50% effectiveness; this will allow you to have two teammates being healed or damage boosted at a time if you learn how to bounce back and forth properly.\n\nNow you **HAVE TO BUY** [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) and  [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf) because this build focuses on [Attack Speed](stat_attack_speed) and [Weapon Power](stat_weapon_power).\n\nThe third item is your choice; I go with [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) in the beginning for the survivability, but drop it fairly soon.",
